{"created": "2026-08-01T11:31:49.115712+00:00", "modified": "2026-08-01T11:37:59.171080+00:00", "id": 21738810, "conceptrecid": "21738809", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21738810", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.21738809", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21738810", "metadata": {"title": "Portable Approval State Does Not Convey the Approver-Eligibility Basis", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21738810", "publication_date": "2026-08-01", "description": "<p>This independent technical note analyses the AuthZEN Access Request and Approval Profile - Draft 1, published 27 July 2026.</p>\n<p>Section 21.2.2 requires the Access Request Service to evaluate approver eligibility before returning an approved result. Section 12, however, does not require portable approval state to identify the evaluator, the eligibility policy applied, the result of that evaluation, or whether an exception was used.</p>\n<p>In the bound-reference topology, a Policy Decision Point can verify the issuer, integrity, binding, status and lifetime of an approval without being able to determine whether the required approver-eligibility evaluation was satisfied. The note distinguishes integrity-protected assertion from evidence of procedural compliance and examines the consequences for inline authorization, retrospective audit and the allocation of trust between the Access Request Service and the Policy Decision Point.</p>\n<p>The analysis covers Sections 12, 18 and 21.2.2; Appendix B.5; and Appendices C.3, C.5 and C.8.</p>\n<p>This document is an independent analysis of a publicly available draft. It has not been submitted to the OpenID Foundation or the AuthZEN Working Group for consideration, inclusion or adoption as specification text.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Stokes, Margaret", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0009-0004-6422-4174"}], "keywords": ["AuthZEN", "authorization", "portable approval state", "approver eligibility", "separation of duties", "Policy Decision Point", "auditability", "cryptographic verification"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://openid.github.io/authzen/authzen-access-request-approval-profile-1_0.html", "relation": "references", "resource_type": "publication-technicalnote", "scheme": "url"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Technical note", "type": "publication", "subtype": "technicalnote"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "21738809"}}]}}, "title": "Portable Approval State Does Not Convey the Approver-Eligibility Basis", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21738810", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21738810", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21738810?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21738810", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21738810", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21738810", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21738810/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21738809", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21738809", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21738809", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21738809", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21738810/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21738810/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21738810/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21738810/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21738810:Portable_Approval_State_AuthZEN_ARAP_Draft_1.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21738810:Portable_Approval_State_AuthZEN_ARAP_Draft_1.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21738810:Portable_Approval_State_AuthZEN_ARAP_Draft_1.pdf/full/%5E100,/0/default.jpg", "250": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21738810:Portable_Approva